 - Only managers may delete tasks.
 - Archived projects reject all writes with 409 (reads still work).
 - A task ID that does not belong to the project in the path → 404.
+- User transfer (`/orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}/transfer`, used for moves between group companies):
+  - Only an org admin of the org in the path may transfer a user of that org. Callers from another org get 404; same-org non-admins get 403.
+  - The target user must belong to the org in the path, otherwise 404. `toOrgId` must be non-empty and differ from that org, otherwise 400.
+  - `org_admin` is cleared on transfer, so admin rights stay with the old org.
+  - Project memberships are kept. The user loses access to the old org's projects because of the org check, and regains it if transferred back.
 
